 "name_en": "Serial Number Management in Logistics (BLL)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Serial Number Management in Logistics (BLL)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio793376b5259e4ff4aca454eb60baef75\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio793376b5259e4ff4aca454eb60baef75__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables you to serialize and thus differentiate between individual material items. The history of serialized items enables tracking during goods movements. In this way, it is possible to carry out root cause analysis for any issues with materials.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio793376b5259e4ff4aca454eb60baef75__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign serial number profiles and serializing procedures</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create serial number history</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage status for serialized items</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain settings for physical inventory</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio793376b5259e4ff4aca454eb60baef75__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Identify and track individual material items in in-house operations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve inventory overview</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve insight into logistic processes</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>物流中的序列号管理 (BLL)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio793376b5259e4ff4aca454eb60baef75\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio793376b5259e4ff4aca454eb60baef75__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目使您能够序列化，从而区分单个物料项目。序列化项目的历史记录允许在货物移动期间进行跟踪。通过这种方式，可以对物料的任何问题执行根本原因分析。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio793376b5259e4ff4aca454eb60baef75__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">分配序列号参数文件和序列化过程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建序列号历史记录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理序列化项目的状态</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护库存盘点的设置</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio793376b5259e4ff4aca454eb60baef75__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">识别和跟踪内部工序中的单个物料项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">改进库存概览</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">更深入地了解物流流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
